WEBVTT

00:00:08,340 --> 00:00:11,820
I don't have a question. I just have a comment.

00:00:11,820 --> 00:00:17,100
I just hope the people won't be afraid to have confidence in the

00:00:17,100 --> 00:00:21,940
rife machine. I've been doing this a long time and my

00:00:21,940 --> 00:00:25,100
cancer didn't happen just overnight and it's not going to

00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:30,620
go away just overnight. But I was supposed to be dead according

00:00:30,620 --> 00:00:38,200
to the biopsy in February of 2018. And here I stand, just

00:00:38,200 --> 00:00:41,300
getting ready to go, put my chickens up for the night. I've

00:00:41,300 --> 00:00:47,200
worked most of the day. The days that I don't feel well. I

00:00:47,200 --> 00:00:51,380
just figure it's the toxins in my body and I know I've got

00:00:51,380 --> 00:00:56,460
to go detox. But there are most days that I don't even remember

00:00:56,460 --> 00:01:04,100
that I have cancer. The days that I've cheated on my diet, I'm

00:01:04,100 --> 00:01:07,740
paying for and I know what I mean I've been doing this long

00:01:07,740 --> 00:01:13,180
enough that I know that it's what I have put in my body. So I

00:01:13,180 --> 00:01:17,660
guess what I'm just trying to say is I believe this works. I've

00:01:17,660 --> 00:01:21,260
never had chemotherapy. I've never had radiation. I still have

00:01:21,260 --> 00:01:28,340
the tumor. I can see it. I can feel it. It's shrinking. So I

00:01:28,340 --> 00:01:33,020
just hope people will get hope from this that it might take

00:01:33,020 --> 00:01:40,060
a while. I can handle it. If it takes another five, 10 years, it

00:01:40,060 --> 00:01:44,100
slowed me down some, but you know what, it's not stopped me. So

00:01:44,100 --> 00:01:48,020
I'm not telling anyone not to go hiking. That's not my message, my

00:01:48,020 --> 00:01:52,820
message is the rifle works. Well, thanks, Chris. So I

00:01:52,820 --> 00:01:56,300
appreciate that. So when I put this zoom presentation together, I

00:01:56,300 --> 00:02:00,620
had considered whether or not by me sort of revealing some of

00:02:00,620 --> 00:02:06,060
the, some of the gaps that can happen that people might feel

00:02:06,060 --> 00:02:10,180
discouraged about the rifle machine. But I guess one of the

00:02:10,180 --> 00:02:13,460
main things that I'm trying to do through this is to show

00:02:13,460 --> 00:02:19,380
people that that the rifle machine is an incredible tool. And

00:02:19,380 --> 00:02:23,660
it's really the real, the primary pillar that we've really

00:02:23,660 --> 00:02:27,260
built our clinic around. And there's no way that we're ever

00:02:27,260 --> 00:02:31,180
going to stop utilizing the rifle machine as long as we are

00:02:31,180 --> 00:02:35,420
allowed to manufacture them and sell them because of the amazing

00:02:35,420 --> 00:02:39,700
things that we've seen happen. But the reality behind it is

00:02:39,740 --> 00:02:45,060
that just like every single thing in this life that is, that

00:02:45,060 --> 00:02:50,580
is touched by humans is that there is an element of imperfection

00:02:50,580 --> 00:02:54,380
that comes with it. And that even though we do our absolute best

00:02:54,380 --> 00:02:59,780
to get as close as we can, that there can be, that there can

00:02:59,780 --> 00:03:05,380
be holes in that perfect intention. And so, you know, it's

00:03:05,380 --> 00:03:08,260
the same thing with everything that we try to do. We want to

00:03:08,260 --> 00:03:14,420
aim to live life in excellence. But that doesn't mean that

00:03:14,420 --> 00:03:18,700
it's always going to move forward perfectly the way that we

00:03:18,700 --> 00:03:21,340
would dream or the way that we that would, you know, we desire,

00:03:21,700 --> 00:03:26,260
you know, God tells us that that man makes his plans, but that

00:03:26,260 --> 00:03:33,420
God's going to direct his steps. And, and so we make a plan on

00:03:33,420 --> 00:03:36,780
the way that we're going to put together this rife program, the

00:03:36,780 --> 00:03:39,540
way that we're going to try to come alongside our patients

00:03:39,540 --> 00:03:43,500
to the best of our ability to help them move forward. But that

00:03:43,500 --> 00:03:47,180
ultimately beyond that, there are elements of this that can be

00:03:47,180 --> 00:03:52,940
beyond our control. And that will do everything that we can to

00:03:52,940 --> 00:03:57,900
come alongside our patients. But when we approach using the

00:03:57,900 --> 00:04:03,420
rife machine as if it is the magic tool that is going to cure

00:04:03,420 --> 00:04:08,700
everything, we can be feeding ourselves a misnomer, and we

00:04:08,700 --> 00:04:12,700
can be setting ourselves up for some disappointment because

00:04:12,700 --> 00:04:17,060
there are things with the rife machine that can be tweaked and

00:04:17,060 --> 00:04:22,380
can be changed and enhanced so that we can get closer to what

00:04:22,380 --> 00:04:26,820
each of our patients need if they're seen that the original

00:04:27,540 --> 00:04:32,220
rife program doesn't seem to be helping them as much as we can.

00:04:32,260 --> 00:04:35,740
And that being said, we could tweak it again and again and

00:04:35,740 --> 00:04:41,740
again. And if their body or their cancer is not something that

00:04:41,740 --> 00:04:45,980
we can get behind, then it might not be something that we can

00:04:45,980 --> 00:04:49,700
get behind. So there's just this balance. There's this balance

00:04:49,700 --> 00:04:54,900
of living in reality and also living with this hope and with

00:04:54,900 --> 00:04:58,340
this trust that we're doing everything that we can. That's

00:04:58,340 --> 00:05:03,180
right to be able to boost our immune system and push it

00:05:03,180 --> 00:05:07,940
forward and overcome this horrible disease. So I'm so

00:05:07,940 --> 00:05:11,660
grateful for your words and your wisdom, crystal and your

00:05:11,660 --> 00:05:17,420
guidance. I greatly appreciate that. And I also hope to that

00:05:17,900 --> 00:05:21,340
what I was saying is not a discouragement to people, but it's

00:05:21,340 --> 00:05:25,900
just again, a reminder that that we are humans trying to help

00:05:25,900 --> 00:05:30,620
other humans and that I am not a cure all and Dr. Connors is

00:05:30,620 --> 00:05:33,780
not a cure all and the rife is not a cure all. But we're going

00:05:33,780 --> 00:05:37,180
to do every single thing that we can to try to come along

00:05:37,180 --> 00:05:40,540
side you and help you if you reach out to us and you ask us

00:05:40,540 --> 00:05:46,940
for it. And and hopefully that will allow us to to have more

00:05:46,940 --> 00:05:50,300
people have an experience like you, crystal, where you're

00:05:50,300 --> 00:05:53,980
able to look back and go multiple years ago, I wasn't even

00:05:53,980 --> 00:05:57,660
supposed to be here, but look at me now and look at the journey

00:05:57,660 --> 00:06:00,260
that I'm walking on. So thank you so much.

